The upstream app-server implementation is not forked or copied into this repository. Vibe Desktop supplies a small launcher and adapts resource paths in the upstream PyInstaller spec so that it freezes the installed wheel. The optional Textual TUI speedups are disabled and excluded from the headless app-server bundle.

